WEBVTT

00:03.410 --> 00:04.790
Always keep a good poker face.

00:05.160 --> 00:06.830
Taking his father's teaching to heart...

00:06.830 --> 00:09.210
The miraculous magician glides amidst the skyscrapers.

00:09.210 --> 00:10.710
In comes Kaitou Kid!

00:11.250 --> 00:13.800
Today's target is "Blue Birthday".

00:14.130 --> 00:16.470
Now, let the show begin!

01:43.970 --> 01:51.230
Detective Conan is brought to you by these sponsors.

01:58.570 --> 02:03.570
THE FATED BLUE BIRTHDAY

02:13.000 --> 02:14.000
Don't let him escape!

02:14.000 --> 02:15.630
After him!

02:22.220 --> 02:24.130
Catch Kaitou Kid!

02:31.520 --> 02:33.850
Bastard, you won't get away!

02:33.850 --> 02:36.810
Hold your sorry ass right there, Kid!

02:43.700 --> 02:47.200
He's fooled by the dummy each and every time...

02:47.200 --> 02:48.490
He never learns, that old dog.

02:50.290 --> 02:51.950
This marks my fifth loot for the month.

02:52.750 --> 02:55.420
And tomorrow's finally my biggest target!

02:55.420 --> 02:57.420
All right, gonna give it my all!

03:01.510 --> 03:02.130
Huh?

03:06.140 --> 03:07.220
Hello?

03:08.550 --> 03:10.810
It's been a while, Kaitou Kid.

03:12.310 --> 03:14.520
Uhm, who are you?

03:14.940 --> 03:17.230
Have you forgotten my voice?

03:17.980 --> 03:21.900
I thought I made myself clear before—
do not lay a finger on the jewels.

03:22.150 --> 03:23.360
Jewels?

03:23.360 --> 03:28.450
We'll let this one slide since the gem you
got this time was not what we're after.

03:28.450 --> 03:32.120
But if you keep this up, we will ice you.

03:33.450 --> 03:35.330
Who was that guy?

03:44.590 --> 03:46.130
"Bold and audacious!

03:46.130 --> 03:48.430
"Kaitou Kid sends out another manifesto for tonight!

03:48.430 --> 03:50.930
"His target is the biggest sapphire in India!

03:51.430 --> 03:56.230
"The sleepless Inspector Nakamori vows
to succeed with bloody eyes," huh?

03:57.350 --> 03:59.730
Guess it's gonna be another easy job for me tonight!

04:05.530 --> 04:06.950
To hell with Kid!

04:06.950 --> 04:08.610
To hell with bold and audacious!

04:08.610 --> 04:10.280
I'M SO PISSED RIGHT NOW!

04:10.910 --> 04:11.450
Aoko?

04:11.830 --> 04:15.500
Thanks to him, my dad didn't get to sleep well this entire week!

04:15.500 --> 04:19.120
Well, he should just give up and catch
some Z's already, that hack inspector!

04:21.500 --> 04:27.510
Geez, today is Aoko's birthday, and yet
Dad still has to deal with Kid even today!

04:28.220 --> 04:28.930
Birthday?

04:30.550 --> 04:32.260
Hey, don't tell me...

04:32.260 --> 04:34.220
You're gonna turn 17 years old?

04:34.640 --> 04:35.520
What's that?

04:35.520 --> 04:37.020
I'm an 11th grader, so isn't that a given?

04:37.810 --> 04:39.100
But...

04:39.100 --> 04:40.520
Your boobs...

04:40.520 --> 04:41.770
Waist...

04:41.770 --> 04:42.520
And butt...

04:44.320 --> 04:47.030
Aoko, could it be you're actually...

04:47.030 --> 04:47.950
A boy?

04:49.860 --> 04:50.950
Forget it!

04:50.950 --> 04:53.450
Kaito, I won't invite you to my birthday party!

04:54.540 --> 04:55.620
You're having a party?

04:56.040 --> 04:57.450
No choice, then!

04:57.450 --> 04:59.000
I've got an unfinished job...

04:59.000 --> 05:02.290
I mean, some errands tonight, so I may be a little late.

05:02.290 --> 05:04.040
But I'll be there just for you!

05:04.040 --> 05:06.210
It's fine if you have errands to run.

05:06.210 --> 05:09.340
You don't have to force yourself since
Keiko and the others will come anyway.

05:09.340 --> 05:10.680
Don't you worry!

05:11.590 --> 05:14.680
I shall perform my magic show for tonight's party...

05:14.680 --> 05:17.180
And make sure you guys have a blast!

05:18.770 --> 05:19.600
Kaito...

05:20.850 --> 05:21.560
Well?

05:21.560 --> 05:22.230
Yeah!

05:22.230 --> 05:23.270
It's a promise!

05:23.270 --> 05:24.820
Yeah, I promise!

05:25.360 --> 05:25.900
Well...

05:26.530 --> 05:28.030
What do you want as a present?

05:29.070 --> 05:30.570
What's the best thing for me?

05:31.070 --> 05:31.700
That's it!

05:32.110 --> 05:33.070
Kaitou Kid!

05:34.070 --> 05:36.990
How about you capture Kid for me?

05:38.200 --> 05:39.620
A good idea if I do say so myself!

05:41.120 --> 05:42.250
That's... not gonna happen.

05:42.540 --> 05:45.380
But, I wonder what reason Kid had for becoming a thief?

05:46.630 --> 05:49.260
He's thrown away things he's stolen before...

05:49.260 --> 05:53.010
And even sometimes has sent them
back to their original owners, right?

05:53.010 --> 05:55.800
I don't care whether he's the world's
best phantom thief or whatnot...

05:56.640 --> 05:59.930
Could it be he's only enjoying the thrill of stealing?

06:00.350 --> 06:01.440
No, that's...

06:01.440 --> 06:03.060
That's it, no doubt about it!

06:03.600 --> 06:08.030
He's making a fool out of my dad who's always burning
his midnight oil just for the purpose of chasing Kid!

06:08.030 --> 06:09.280
That must be it!

06:09.900 --> 06:11.650
Don't get too worked up.

06:11.650 --> 06:13.410
Kid is just another thief...

06:13.410 --> 06:14.820
I won't forgive him!

06:14.820 --> 06:18.040
Making fun of someone that's
working hard and trying their best...

06:18.040 --> 06:19.450
I will never forgive him for that!

06:22.660 --> 06:23.500
Aoko...

06:25.000 --> 06:26.000
That's not it.

06:26.920 --> 06:29.300
I never wanted to make a fool out of the inspector...

06:29.300 --> 06:31.800
And I don't enjoy stealing things, either.

06:33.090 --> 06:33.800
﻿I...

06:35.640 --> 06:37.760
I only wanted to ascertain the truth.

06:44.560 --> 06:47.520
The truth of the world-renowned magician from eight years ago...

06:47.520 --> 06:50.230
Who also doubled as Kaitou Kid...

06:51.070 --> 06:54.860
And his death and those who killed
him, my father, Kuroba Touichi!

06:58.030 --> 06:59.910
If I keep moonlighting as Kaitou Kid...

06:59.910 --> 07:03.080
I bet those bastards who killed Dad will show themselves.

07:05.460 --> 07:06.790
So until then...

07:07.330 --> 07:09.000
I must become Kaitou Kid...

07:11.760 --> 07:13.340
And there's no way I'd give up!

07:15.840 --> 07:17.300
Hurry, hurry, Aoko!

07:17.300 --> 07:18.220
Blow out the candles!

07:20.890 --> 07:23.100
Happy birthday, Aoko!

07:23.100 --> 07:24.180
Thank you, everyone!

07:24.430 --> 07:26.140
Well, where's your hubby?

07:26.940 --> 07:27.400
Hubby?

07:27.690 --> 07:30.230
Geez, who else but Kaito-kun!

07:30.820 --> 07:32.610
Don't say strange things like that!

07:32.610 --> 07:34.240
There you go again!

07:34.240 --> 07:35.950
I bet you already invited him, no?

07:35.950 --> 07:37.410
Isn't he late?

07:37.410 --> 07:39.490
Well, since it's Kaito-kun we're talking about...

07:39.490 --> 07:43.500
I bet he's just gonna show up at some weird
place all of a sudden and surprise us, right?

07:43.500 --> 07:44.870
Right, right, that must be it!

07:48.130 --> 07:49.630
Don't you worry!

07:49.630 --> 07:53.760
I shall perform my magic show tonight
and make sure you guys have a blast!

07:56.880 --> 07:59.010
You definitely will come, won't you, Kaito?

07:59.550 --> 08:01.010
You promised me...

08:10.560 --> 08:13.280
Will it be all right, Inspector Nakamori?

08:13.280 --> 08:18.990
Are you saying with just this kind of security, you'll be able
to protect the largest sapphire in India, the "Blue Birthday"?

08:19.610 --> 08:21.830
Leave it to us, Director.

08:21.830 --> 08:26.710
I, Nakamori Ginzou, shall swear upon my
life and protect that jewel to the very end!

08:27.250 --> 08:29.710
Well, your life is nothing compared to—

08:30.580 --> 08:31.920
Ah, no.

08:31.920 --> 08:34.840
But, just from what I see, how is this tight security?

08:36.720 --> 08:38.130
Please take a look at this.

08:40.510 --> 08:41.930
These are laser beams?

08:42.470 --> 08:44.720
And not just your average lasers.

08:49.020 --> 08:50.560
In short, Kid will also...

08:54.780 --> 08:55.650
Cough.

08:55.860 --> 08:59.150
Not to mention this unbreakable fence made of special alloys!

08:59.490 --> 09:00.610
Dammit, dammit...

09:00.860 --> 09:02.280
Shit!

09:02.620 --> 09:04.080
What's more, what's more!

09:04.080 --> 09:06.200
The floors are surrounded by high electric currents!

09:08.040 --> 09:10.210
Bibbidi-bobbidi-boobooboo!

09:11.290 --> 09:12.540
How impressive!

09:12.540 --> 09:15.460
After all, Kaitou Kid is just a fleshed human being.

09:15.460 --> 09:18.090
He's not going to be a fool and go near it.

09:22.300 --> 09:24.760
You're right, I'm not a fool.

09:24.760 --> 09:27.270
Sorry to crash in when you're so psyched up, Inspector.

09:32.560 --> 09:35.570
This time, his manifesto definitely will end in failure—

09:35.570 --> 09:36.780
Inspector, look!

09:39.990 --> 09:41.150
Kaitou Kid!

09:42.030 --> 09:43.070
How did he get in?

09:43.660 --> 09:45.280
You bastard...

09:45.280 --> 09:47.830
Cut off the electricity and unlock the fence!

09:47.830 --> 09:48.200
Roger!

09:53.380 --> 09:54.290
Now's the time!

09:54.290 --> 09:55.250
Seize him!

10:01.260 --> 10:03.430
Wow, they're at it, they're at it!

10:04.180 --> 10:05.890
Then, I'll join too!

10:14.900 --> 10:16.310
Give it up, Kid!

10:17.440 --> 10:18.190
This is...

10:18.530 --> 10:19.230
Inspector!

10:21.070 --> 10:21.780
Kid!

10:22.320 --> 10:25.160
Blue Birthday is now undoubtedly in my possession.

10:25.160 --> 10:26.950
May we meet again, Inspector Nakamori.

10:30.790 --> 10:31.200
Wait!

10:31.620 --> 10:33.370
Wait, Kid!

10:36.210 --> 10:38.880
Excellent, operation part one is a success.

10:39.960 --> 10:41.920
Director, please open up the fence.

10:42.880 --> 10:43.380
Yes!

10:45.720 --> 10:46.930
Could it be, Inspector...

10:46.930 --> 10:50.350
That the stolen jewel was a fake?

10:50.350 --> 10:51.560
No, no.

10:51.560 --> 10:55.270
Something like that wouldn't have fooled Kid.

10:55.270 --> 10:57.480
But, you just said your plan was a success...

10:59.940 --> 11:02.990
Operation Kaitou Kid's Capture: Part 2!

11:02.990 --> 11:04.820
Initiating hideout annihilation phase!

11:05.910 --> 11:08.950
Actually, on the chain of that jewel...

11:08.950 --> 11:11.910
We have planted an extremely tiny transmitter.

11:11.910 --> 11:16.040
It's a special device that even Kaitou
Kid would never be able to remove!

11:16.960 --> 11:18.670
You did that without my permission?

11:18.670 --> 11:21.880
In short, as long as the jewel is in Kid's possession...

11:21.880 --> 11:25.840
Whichever part of this world he flees to,
he will never be able to escape from me!

11:28.510 --> 11:31.140
Inspector, we have Kid's signal from this building's rooftop!

11:31.140 --> 11:33.480
Good, continue tracking him like that.

11:33.480 --> 11:35.440
And call the choppers and ground forces now!

11:35.440 --> 11:35.810
Roger!

11:36.230 --> 11:39.520
It bothers me when you mess around
with my jewel without permission...

11:39.520 --> 11:41.690
Freaking Kid, be prepared.

11:41.690 --> 11:44.150
I shall exterminate your hideout as well as you!

11:44.740 --> 11:47.660
This isn't good, look at the time...

11:47.660 --> 11:50.580
If I don't hurry, Aoko's birthday party will end!

11:51.540 --> 11:52.660
It's a promise!

11:52.660 --> 11:54.290
Yeah, I promise!

11:54.700 --> 11:56.670
Got it, got it, loud and clear.

11:57.460 --> 12:00.460
All right, just a hop, skip, and jump to Aoko's place!

12:35.450 --> 12:37.280
He's late, that Kaito-kun...

12:37.280 --> 12:38.330
I wonder what happened?

12:46.630 --> 12:48.960
I thought I'd already warned...

12:48.960 --> 12:51.130
That you are not to lay a finger on the jewels.

12:51.510 --> 12:52.800
This voice...

12:52.800 --> 12:54.010
The caller from yesterday?

12:55.590 --> 12:57.010
It's been a long time...

12:57.010 --> 12:58.220
Kaitou Kid.

12:58.430 --> 12:59.550
No...

12:59.550 --> 13:01.520
Kuroba Touichi!

13:02.430 --> 13:09.270
To think a foolish man who should've lost his life eight
years ago after getting his hands on our target gem...

13:09.270 --> 13:11.110
Is still alive and kicking!

13:12.030 --> 13:13.190
Don't tell me...

13:13.190 --> 13:15.030
These bastards are the ones who killed my dad!?

13:19.910 --> 13:21.620
Is that how it was!?

13:26.160 --> 13:28.210
Hand over that jewel.

13:28.210 --> 13:31.000
If you oblige and hand over it, I'll spare your life.

13:31.840 --> 13:32.840
And if I refuse?

13:34.590 --> 13:35.880
Then, once again...

13:36.630 --> 13:37.430
You die!

13:56.240 --> 13:58.160
Everyone, thanks for coming today.

13:58.160 --> 14:00.030
I had lots of fun, Aoko.

14:00.030 --> 14:03.540
Although if Kaito-kun could've come,
it would've been more exciting.

14:03.540 --> 14:05.250
It's all right, forget about that guy.

14:05.250 --> 14:06.910
He told me he had some errands to run.

14:07.410 --> 14:08.620
We're off then, Aoko.

14:08.620 --> 14:09.670
See you tomorrow.

14:09.670 --> 14:10.630
Bye-bye.

14:11.290 --> 14:12.250
Good night.

14:12.250 --> 14:13.380
That was fun!

14:25.770 --> 14:27.810
Great work, Snake.

14:28.140 --> 14:31.900
Oh, so this is that famed Blue Birthday?

14:31.900 --> 14:33.230
That's another one down.

14:33.610 --> 14:36.820
We have to report this to the boss promptly.

14:36.820 --> 14:38.150
But...

14:38.150 --> 14:40.320
Why does the boss insist on obtaining such a jewel?

14:40.990 --> 14:44.700
Something like that shouldn't have
been an inconvenience to that person.

14:45.330 --> 14:46.700
Of course.

14:47.870 --> 14:53.040
But, even someone that great is
inconvenienced by a certain thing.

14:54.170 --> 14:55.800
It is "life".

14:55.800 --> 14:56.710
Life?

14:57.170 --> 15:05.310
For starters, this Blue Birthday is one of the
legendary Big Jewels scattered around the world.

15:05.310 --> 15:09.230
If this is what that person is after...

15:09.230 --> 15:13.810
We can assume some sort of incredible power
beyond human knowledge is likely embedded in it.

15:13.810 --> 15:15.650
Incredible power?

15:15.940 --> 15:18.070
Once every ten thousand years...

15:18.070 --> 15:22.320
A comet named Volley will approach
earth — are you familiar with that?

15:23.030 --> 15:25.160
According to ancient legend...

15:26.120 --> 15:31.290
When the Volley's Comet approaches, one
must offer the gem of life to the full moon.

15:31.290 --> 15:34.040
Upon doing so, tears will be shed.

15:34.040 --> 15:34.790
Tears?

15:35.090 --> 15:36.630
And...

15:36.630 --> 15:39.130
Whoever drinks the tears...

15:40.510 --> 15:41.340
What will happen?

15:43.220 --> 15:49.310
Since long ago, the final and ultimate dream
of mankind that has never materialized...

15:50.310 --> 15:52.640
Shall come true—Immortality!

15:53.560 --> 15:55.060
Immortality!?

15:55.060 --> 16:00.570
But, only one of the Big Jewels possesses said power.

16:01.280 --> 16:05.370
Unfortunately, it is still unbeknownst
to us which of the jewels it is.

16:05.370 --> 16:06.490
So that's why...

16:06.780 --> 16:07.830
Right.

16:07.830 --> 16:11.000
We have no choice but to get them one by one.

16:11.000 --> 16:15.170
Until the next time Volley's Comet
comes into the Earth's reach.

16:15.170 --> 16:17.920
But, how do we distinguish them?

16:17.920 --> 16:19.710
Elementary.

16:19.710 --> 16:22.260
You'll find out if you shine moonlight on it.

16:22.720 --> 16:25.430
If the jewel is embedded with said power...

16:25.430 --> 16:30.350
The other gem resting inside will radiate a bright red light.

16:30.810 --> 16:33.060
That's the gem of life...

16:33.060 --> 16:34.480
Pandora.

16:36.190 --> 16:36.770
What!?

16:36.770 --> 16:38.690
WRONG ONE

16:37.900 --> 16:38.690
This is...

16:39.900 --> 16:41.230
I see.

16:41.230 --> 16:42.610
So I need to shine it at the moon?

16:46.110 --> 16:47.030
Kaitou Kid!

16:49.200 --> 16:50.620
Bastard, you botched it!

16:50.620 --> 16:52.370
No, I did hit his heart...

16:52.700 --> 16:54.290
It really was a clean hit...

16:54.290 --> 16:57.790
On this Blue Birthday that was inside my chest pocket!

16:58.540 --> 16:59.750
Then, what's this?

16:59.750 --> 17:02.210
A counterfeit I made, of course.

17:02.590 --> 17:05.090
It's the most basic of magic tricks: preparation!

17:06.840 --> 17:07.890
You bastard!

17:09.350 --> 17:10.060
Fire!

17:10.060 --> 17:11.010
Fire, fire!

17:16.850 --> 17:18.690
If you want this so bad...

17:18.690 --> 17:19.900
I'll give it to you!

17:24.530 --> 17:25.900
The Blue Birthday...

17:26.360 --> 17:28.320
What a pity.

17:28.320 --> 17:30.780
That one doesn't have Pandora in it either.

17:30.780 --> 17:32.540
Instead, there's something troublesome on it!

17:34.700 --> 17:35.460
What's this?

17:36.500 --> 17:37.370
A transmitter!

17:38.460 --> 17:40.000
To hell with immortality!

17:40.000 --> 17:41.420
Don't make me laugh!

17:42.090 --> 17:43.550
Tell your mastermind this:

17:43.550 --> 17:48.130
I, Kaitou Kid, shall locate that Pandora gem before you do...

17:48.130 --> 17:50.600
And shatter it into tiny pieces!

17:52.890 --> 17:54.220
You scoundrel, Kid!

17:59.350 --> 18:00.860
Kaitou Kid!

18:00.860 --> 18:02.610
Your hideout is surrounded!

18:02.610 --> 18:03.940
Give yourself up now!

18:04.230 --> 18:06.320
Well, what will you do?

18:08.610 --> 18:09.280
Damn!

18:10.120 --> 18:11.200
We have no choice.

18:11.200 --> 18:12.620
Abandon this hideout!

18:13.200 --> 18:15.290
Escape via the underground path!

18:17.910 --> 18:20.130
Brace yourself, Kaitou Kid!

18:20.920 --> 18:22.130
Where is he?

18:22.130 --> 18:23.250
Where's he hiding now?

18:24.840 --> 18:25.840
Nobody's here!

18:25.840 --> 18:26.880
It's all empty!

18:27.420 --> 18:28.880
What now?

18:33.510 --> 18:36.350
Isn't this the Blue Birthday?

18:36.350 --> 18:38.440
Wonderful, you retrieved it!

18:39.100 --> 18:40.730
You did it again, Inspector!

18:40.730 --> 18:44.940
Well, uhm, it's unfortunate we lost Kid again...

18:44.940 --> 18:47.360
But our operation is still a success!

18:47.360 --> 18:48.900
It's a party tonight!

18:49.360 --> 18:50.950
Let's all make some noise!

19:10.050 --> 19:11.550
This is bad!

19:11.550 --> 19:13.850
Aoko's birthday is coming to an end soon!

19:16.140 --> 19:18.310
Wait a sec, where am I?

19:21.810 --> 19:23.100
Damn, this distance...

19:23.520 --> 19:24.810
I don't think I'll make it...

19:26.900 --> 19:28.820
I see, that's it!

19:43.120 --> 19:44.420
Hello, Aoko?

19:44.420 --> 19:47.000
My bad, but I don't think I'd be able to make it there tonight...

19:47.840 --> 19:50.050
Aww snaps, only three minutes left?

19:51.420 --> 19:52.590
Are you listening?

19:52.590 --> 19:53.430
Aoko?

19:53.680 --> 19:55.850
JERKAITO!

19:56.390 --> 19:59.140
You made a promise, so why didn't you come!?

19:59.470 --> 20:02.190
Aoko... Aoko waited all this time!

20:03.480 --> 20:06.730
"A blast with your magic show" my foot...

20:07.650 --> 20:09.110
I HATE YOU!

20:10.990 --> 20:13.700
Don't say things like that—just look outside your window.

20:14.450 --> 20:15.320
Aoko?

20:17.950 --> 20:19.080
Outside the window?

20:42.430 --> 20:43.980
Keep your eyes peeled, Aoko.

20:43.980 --> 20:45.650
This is my magic show!

20:56.530 --> 20:57.320
No way...

20:58.740 --> 21:00.580
It's still too early to be surprised!

21:10.710 --> 21:12.380
What's going on?

21:12.380 --> 21:14.300
So noisy...

21:14.300 --> 21:15.260
Fireworks?

21:15.720 --> 21:17.340
No kidding!?

21:17.760 --> 21:18.680
What's that?

21:19.100 --> 21:20.010
What's going on?

21:32.190 --> 21:33.900
"Blue Birthday"?

21:34.490 --> 21:38.490
Come to think of it, isn't today someone's birthday?

21:38.490 --> 21:39.490
Inspector!

21:39.490 --> 21:41.200
Here, say when!

21:42.660 --> 21:44.040
Whatever!

21:44.040 --> 21:45.540
Another round of toast!

21:45.540 --> 21:47.580
Cheers!

21:51.000 --> 21:51.960
Beautiful!

